WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:22.772
What's wrong?

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.442
Your eyes.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:30.280
It's the same color as your eyes.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:37.495
The way I felt when I saw this...

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.498
This feeling...

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:45.462
What is it called?

00:01:20.288 --> 00:01:21.539
"Major Gilbert.

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:24.209
I've been in the hospital
for 120 days now.

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:27.545
My strength has almost recovered.

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:30.131
Movement is still a little difficult,

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:31.966
but I can perform my duties.

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:34.969
Please let me return to my post soon."

